  MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Triolith (LICENSE)

Rewritten: the SQLite pipeline and its twenty tools became one JSON document under the home and thirteen tools, with the same idea behind them - the model proposes a score a dimension with cited evidence ids and the code verifies the citations, zeroes what nobody can source and computes the total; the draft gate reads the log, the contact route, the working-day hold and the per-channel cap before it names a channel; and the draft lint checks every number against the founder's verified claims and the investor's cited facts, then reports the style tells as warnings. The contact route, the rule of three, the per-firm pass and the reachability score are ported as they were, and the manual, the command and the settings section are new. Left out, because each needs a service or a tool the cell does not have: the fetching of investor pages, mailbox search, the LinkedIn reads and the caps enforced around a LinkedIn tool, Gmail or Graph draft placement and reply classification - the cell talks to no network and sends nothing, so the mail and LinkedIn steps stay the model's own tools with the pipeline file as the record; the thirteen profile branches, the setup interview, the demo data and the automation blueprints are dropped, and the profile is a flat set of fields with the claims beside it.
